["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">圏</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>圈；范围；区域</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かこ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">圏</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">圈；范围；地域；地带；阵营；（数学）范畴</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">酸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>酸味；酸；苦涩</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">酸素</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんそ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">氧；氧气</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">酸性</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">酸性；酸性的；呈酸性的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">酸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">酸；酸味；酸的味道</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">罰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>惩罚；处罚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バツ・バチ・ハツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ばっ.する</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">罰する</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばっする</span><span class=\"k-wz\">惩罚；处罚；处以罚款</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">罰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">(神的)惩罚；诅咒；报应</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刑罰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいばつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刑罚；处罚；判刑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">滅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>毁灭；灭亡；覆灭；消灭；摧毁</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">メツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほろ.びる・ほろ.ぶ・ほろ.ぼす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶滅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜつめつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灭绝；消灭；根除；消灭；扑灭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">滅多に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めったに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">很少；难得；罕见</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">全滅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜんめつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">全面摧毁；彻底毁灭；消灭；被歼灭；全面失败；彻底失败</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">礎</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>基石；地基石</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いしずえ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">基礎</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きそ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">基础；根基；基底</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">腐</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>腐烂；腐败；酸化</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くさ.る・-くさ.る・くさ.れる・くさ.れ・くさ.らす・くさ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">腐る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くさる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">腐烂；变质；腐坏；溃烂；（牛奶等）变酸；腐蚀；风化；破碎；变得无用；迟钝；衰弱；生疏；堕落；道德沦丧；腐败；腐化；沮丧；气馁；精神萎靡；情绪低落；厚颜无耻地；无耻地；输掉赌注；湿透；浑身湿漉漉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">腐敗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふはい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">腐烂；腐朽；腐败；变质；腐败；堕落；衰败；邪恶</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">脚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>腿；脚；底座；起落架；下部</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キャク・キャ・カク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脚色</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゃくしょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（小说等的）戏剧化；（为舞台或银幕的）改编；（对事实的）润色；夸大；渲染</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脚本</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゃくほん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">剧本；脚本；剧本稿</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">潮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>潮汐；潮水；时机</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しお・うしお</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">潮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うしお</span><span class=\"k-wz\">潮；潮流；海水；（烹饪）用海水煮鱼或贝类的清汤；（烹饪）盐水煮带骨白身鱼</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">梅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>梅子；梅树；梅花</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うめ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">梅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">梅；日本杏；日本李；中国梅；最低等；三级制中的最低级</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">梅雨</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つゆ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">梅雨季节；雨季（东亚地区，在日本通常从6月初到7月中旬）；梅雨</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">梅干</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うめぼし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">梅干；腌梅；盐渍梅干</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">尽</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>竭尽；用尽；尽力；侍奉；全部</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジン・サン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.きる・つ.くす・つ.かす・-づ.く・-ず.く・ことごと.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">尽きる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つきる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">用尽；耗尽；消耗完；告终</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">尽くす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つくす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">用尽；耗尽；用完；专心致力于；尽力；效力；为…服务；彻底做；完全做；充分做</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">僕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>我（男性自称）；仆人；男仆</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しもべ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">僕</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しもべ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">仆人；男仆；奴仆</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">桜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>樱花</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ・ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さくら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">桜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さくら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">樱花树；樱花；樱；浅粉红色；托儿；假买家；（花钱雇来的）充场观众；冒充顾客的同伙；雇来捧场鼓掌的人；马肉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">孤</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>孤儿；孤独；单独</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">孤児</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孤儿；孤独者；无友之人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">孤独</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こどく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孤独；寂寞；孤立</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">孤立</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こりつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孤立；孤独；形单影只</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">炎</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>火焰；炎症；燃烧</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほのお</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">炎</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほのお</span><span class=\"k-wz\">火焰；火苗；（爱、嫉妒、愤怒等强烈感情的）烈焰；激情</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">賠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>赔偿；补偿</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">賠償</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばいしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赔偿；赔款；补偿金</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">句</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>句子；段落；节；诗句；俳句计数单位</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">句</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">く</span><span class=\"k-wz\">文段；句子；段落；章节；短语；词组；诗句（日本诗歌中的五音或七音；汉诗中的四字、五字或七字）；俳句；连歌等的开头十七音；格言；谚语；惯用语；表达方式；子句（如数据库查询语言中的）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">文句</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もんく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怨言；牢骚；异议；词句；措辞；表述</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">俳句</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">俳句；十七音诗（通常为三行，分别为五、七、五音）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鋼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>钢</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span clas