读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">噴火</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふんか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喷发；火山喷发</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">噴水</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふんすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喷泉；喷水池</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">噴出</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふんしゅつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喷出；喷涌；喷射；爆发；迸发</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">誇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>夸耀；自豪；骄傲；得意</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほこ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誇り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほこり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">骄傲；自豪；荣誉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誇張</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">夸张；夸大</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誇る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほこる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">夸耀；以…自豪；为…感到骄傲</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">祥</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>吉祥；幸福；好兆头；幸运</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さいわ.い・きざ.し・よ.い・つまび.らか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">牲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>牲